        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 28W-Teak Decorative Teak Wood Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning design door handle from the new <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>Wood Door Pull</b></a>  collection, combines the warmth and beauty of  Teak wood with Decorative  bold solid brass mounting brackets (mounting brackets weigh almost 3 lbs. each). Assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Teak handle is unstained in its natural color. Staining is not required. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTeak is used for these door handles because of its hard, strong, durable characteristics. It is also  resistant to insects and  warping, even when exposed directly to harsh weather, making it the ideal choice for exterior doors. Great door pull for residential doors and commercial doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions 28W-Teak Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Standard Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount - 7\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 10\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 16\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/36: Total Length 36\" - Center to Center Mount - 24\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/48: Total Length 48\" - Center to Center Mount - 40\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/60: Total Length 60\" - Center to Center Mount - 52\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-28W-Teak/72: Total Length 72\" - Center to Center Mount - 60\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This Teak wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Teak Wood Commercial  Door Handles, First Impressions 28W-Teak",
                "description": "First Impressions 28W Teak Wood Door handle from First Impressions. Available in 7 different lengths from 12 inches - 72 inches. This stunning design door handle from the new Teak collection, combines the warmth and beauty of  Teak wood with Decorative  bold solid brass mounting brackets (mounting brackets weigh almost 3 lbs. each). Assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality innovational door pull designs.",
